    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2308540/extras/10280a02623feae4356d7948cdd67dd7.avif?t=1680965711\" /></span><br><br>Sinful Soul is a mystical interactive visual novel with a fascinating and extensive storyline. The player finds themselves in the shoes of our main character, who is given a one-time chance to pursue the life he always dreamed of, faced with a decision that could change his fate forever. &quot;The Sinful Soul&quot; club inviting players to join a private club where it is possible to fulfill even the most sinful and daring desires.<br>However, otherworldly forces conspire to manipulate his choice and lead him down the path of damnation, taking away everything that holds dear. In this game, your choices shape the story as you progress. Will you face eternal damnation, or will you find heaven on Earth?<br>Your fate is in your hands.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2308540/extras/b35692e54fb22b15cf6f8c6694294579.avif?t=1680965711\" /></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2308540/extras/343b08efbf52c7d9ee246b7ca1929816.avif?t=1680965711\" /></span><br>                               <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2308540/extras/277f2080b0fadc847b76f23458599b9a.avif?t=1680965711\" /></span><br>                                  <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2308540/extras/2aa1d1c418ad080a2a5c7f43c2fd0664.avif?t=1680965711\" /></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/23